ent-OrbitraRatvarVitality = vitality matrix
    .desc = A glowing blue sigil of interwoven brass lines.
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-vitality = Vitality Matrix
orbitra-ratvar-scripture-vitality-desc = Every two seconds, drains an organic occupant to replenish the cult's separate vitality pool. Spends vitality to heal allies or revive an intact, unrotted human cultist body with its own mind. Spares convertible humans until the ark is activated. Does not create cogscarabs or replace a body's player.
orbitra-ratvar-vitality-stock = Cult vitality: { $amount }. This does not power mechanisms.
